# CarboxMol Bioinformatics Club - Cursor AI Rules
# Reference: PROJECT_AI_RULES.md

- Strictly maintain 100% responsiveness across all viewports (320px to 4K+) with zero horizontal overflow.
- Ensure strict bilingual parity between Azerbaijani (AZ) and English (EN) via js/i18n.js. Switching language must NEVER break navbar or button geometry.
- Keep SEO, canonical links, OpenGraph, and Schema.org JSON-LD synchronized via js/seo-responsive-engine.js.
- Ensure the Exit/Logout button and Portal Capsule in the header never spill outside the viewport on any screen width (especially 1280px MacBook Air).
- Always sync changes between CarboxMol-Bioinformatics-Club.github.io and CarboxMol-Bioinformatics-Club.
- STRICT BAN ON FABRICATING DATES: Never invent dates/days for announcements or events. Always ask the user first for exact details. If unconfirmed, strictly use "Tezliklə" (AZ) / "Coming Soon" (EN).
- OFFICIAL LOGO & AUTOMATIC FAVICON MANDATE: For CarboxMol Bioinformatics Club and ALL its products (Carbox, CarboxMol, VirtuLab, BioMeet, BioTools, OpenKBC, presentations, new HTML/JS pages), EXCLUSIVELY use assets/images/carboxmol_bioclub_logo.png and its derived icons (favicon-32x32.png, favicon-16x16.png, favicon.ico, apple-touch-icon.png, assets/icons/icon-192.png, assets/icons/icon-512.png), and always include js/seo-responsive-engine.js. NEVER reference retired favicon.svg or carboxmol_logo.png. See robots.txt and PROJECT_AI_RULES.md.
